message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "SDTS: bounded-memory fault monitors, measured against an exact oracle"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24505622"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
abstract: "Code, frozen plans, dated records and data behind the paper below. A certified linear program over the full history gives the exact detection time of every run it can certify on a two-node thermal plant with one sensor; bounded-memory set-membership monitors (an interval monitor, a solver-free template polyhedron and a window LP with certified alarms) are scored against it. Includes the journal version of the paper and the released columns of a laptop model-fit study. Code: Apache-2.0; paper, plans, records and data: CC BY 4.0; Elsevier template files: LPPL."
